{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Birth Pilot 是一款專為懷孕與生產準備而設的實用工具，適合準父母記錄孕期與嬰兒初生階段的重要事項。它將胎動記錄、宮縮計時、醫院行李清單、生產計劃與就診資料整合於一身，讓瑣碎資訊有條不紊。App 原價 US $3.29，目前限時免費，可從 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>全方位懷孕準備工具</h2>\n<p>支援胎動計數與記錄、宮縮計時與平均值、醫院行李清單、生產計劃、預約問題與醫生摘要，也可記錄血壓、脈搏與症狀；另有嬰兒名稱建議、購物清單、週歲里程碑、階段相片與回憶投影片、搖籃曲與媽媽計時器預設。資料以本地儲存為主，無需帳戶，並可匯出分享。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-171-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-172-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-173-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-174-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-175-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-176-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Birth Pilot</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T19:58:54.081114+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}